{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/aee7f164242c168a1b470209684c322e.avif?t=1767798903\" width=1280 height=667 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/7e78bfc056028d05f058bc2e9626615c.avif?t=1767798903\" width=538 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a journey like no other in this narrative board game.\u00a0 The award-winning board game has been brought to life for the first time in an adaptation that will challenge your skills, assault your sanity and reward determination.\u00a0 Lead a diverse team of investigators in a globe-spanning adventure to stop the rise of the Ancient Ones: eldritch powers beyond comprehension that will destroy the entire world if awoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This turn-based adventure features hundreds of encounters, dozens of items and multiple Ancient Ones to pit your party against.\u00a0 A dynamic encounter system will change with your choices and challenge your strategies ensuring unique playthroughs and a world shaped by your decisions.\u00a0 In victory or defeat, this will be your story to sear across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/c404612d48dfb2ce1dbce1d24300dba2.avif?t=1767798903\" width=538 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A world steeped in rich lore and atmosphere.</i>\u00a0 Craft a tale for the ages by combining cards to choose both your challenges and your tools for overcoming them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lead a team of iconic characters.</i>\u00a0 Assemble spies, cultists, soldiers, shamans, psychics and more on your quest against the Ancient Ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get straight to the action</i>.\u00a0 A new medium handles the bookkeeping for you: allowing you to focus on the choices that matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be immersed in the world as never before.\u00a0\u00a0</i>Voiced\u00a0characters and a rich score draw you in to uncover occult secrets.\u00a0 A watchful guide will narrate your tale as you press forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple difficulties and Ancient Ones to ensure that the story told is\u00a0<i>your</i> story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089610?t=1767798903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089610?t=1767798903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/70530c3722d1b1fe7c9baa69df1cd2a71dc6ee7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767798903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/70530c3722d1b1fe7c9baa69df1cd2a71dc6ee7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767798903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is no sexual content in the game.  Battles do occur but they are highly abstracted; consisting of two portraits on either side of the screen and dice rolled in a box between them.  Players may have cards by the box with pictures of weapons on them.\r\n\r\nReferences and allusions are made to madness, loss, injury and hospitalization.  These are, for the most part, played straight though they are not heavily emphasized or dwelt on."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/aee7f164242c168a1b470209684c322e.avif?t=1767798903\" width=1280 height=667 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/7e78bfc056028d05f058bc2e9626615c.avif?t=1767798903\" width=538 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a journey like no other in this narrative board game.\u00a0 The award-winning board game has been brought to life for the first time in an adaptation that will challenge your skills, assault your sanity and reward determination.\u00a0 Lead a diverse team of investigators in a globe-spanning adventure to stop the rise of the Ancient Ones: eldritch powers beyond comprehension that will destroy the entire world if awoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This turn-based adventure features hundreds of encounters, dozens of items and multiple Ancient Ones to pit your party against.\u00a0 A dynamic encounter system will change with your choices and challenge your strategies ensuring unique playthroughs and a world shaped by your decisions.\u00a0 In victory or defeat, this will be your story to sear across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089610/extras/c404612d48dfb2ce1dbce1d24300dba2.avif?t=1767798903\" width=538 heig