short_description":"Uncover ancient cults, battle horrific monsters and thwart the rise of unfathomable Ancient Ones in a 1920s-themed adventure. In this faithful adaptation of the classic board game, you must race against time to save humanity from ancient powers and dark secrets before all is lost.","steam_appid":4089610,"support_info":{"email":"sales@csdisoftware.com","url":"www.csdisoftware.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.youtube.com/@ehdigitalgame"}